OL,3,GNEWSA'Reading group helped me brave the
OL,4,Aoutdoors'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who did not leave home for 18
OL,7,Fmonths other than for his mother's
OL,8,Ffuneral has said an outdoor book group
OL,9,Fturned his life around.
OL,11,FIan Kirby was attacked by an intruder
OL,12,Fin his home in October 2019, which left
OL,13,Fhim feeling unable to leave his house.
OL,14,FHe and his mother then shielded
OL,15,Ftogether during the Covid-19 pandemic
OL,16,Funtil her death in September 2020.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
