OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Reading group helped me brave the
OL,4,Aoutdoors'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe eventually braved leaving his Ryton
OL,7,Fhome in August 2021 to join others in
OL,8,FChopwell Woods for Gateshead Libraries'
OL,9,FReading Ramblers group, where he
OL,10,Fdiscovered Carrying David, the
OL,11,Fautobiography of boxer Glenn McCrory.
OL,13,F"I read the whole of the book without
OL,14,Fstopping and it touched me deeply, the
OL,15,Fbook changed my life," Kirby said.
